WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:31.333
In the previous two verses,

2
00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:32.416
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:35.458
spoke about the misguided people in detail.

4
00:00:35.458 --> 00:00:37.083
Now in this verse, Lord Krishna

5
00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:38.125
describes those

6
00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:39.625
divine souls

7
00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:42.125
who understand Him fully.

8
00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:44.500
They always remain in pure devotion

9
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.916
and who always live under

10
00:00:45.916 --> 00:00:47.000
His divine spiritual

11
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.000
power's protection.

12
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.583
Lord Krishna calls them mahatmas.

13
00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:54.250
So let us hear what Lord Krishna

14
00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:56.625
says regarding them.

15
00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:05.583
After all, who does Lord Krishna
 call a mahatma?

16
00:01:05.583 --> 00:01:06.750
In this verse, Lord Krishna

17
00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.416
describes mahatmas, telling us

18
00:01:09.416 --> 00:01:11.250
that those souls are great

19
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.000
who know Him as Parabrahman –

20
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.958
the cause of creation and

21
00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:18.000
the eternal existence.

22
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:18.916
And these mahatmas,

23
00:01:18.916 --> 00:01:21.625
freed from the influence of material nature,

24
00:01:21.625 --> 00:01:23.791
take shelter in Lord Krishna's

25
00:01:23.791 --> 00:01:25.791
divine nature.

26
00:01:25.791 --> 00:01:29.458
This is possible only when with complete faith

27
00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:30.750
and devotion we surrender

28
00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:32.791
to Lord Krishna.

29
00:01:32.791 --> 00:01:33.791
These mahatmas

30
00:01:33.791 --> 00:01:34.958
remain fully absorbed

31
00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:37.208
in the service of Lord Krishna,

32
00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:39.958
and their mind does not wander elsewhere.

33
00:01:39.958 --> 00:01:41.333
Their mind and actions

34
00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:42.458
become centred

35
00:01:42.458 --> 00:01:44.041
only in Lord Krishna.

36
00:01:44.041 --> 00:01:46.500
They neither desire material pleasures,

37
00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.541
nor waste time chasing

38
00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:51.500
fanciful or speculative knowledge,

39
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.000
nor do they seek other deities

40
00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.000
out of a desire for something.

41
00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.916
They honour them, of course,

42
00:01:58.916 --> 00:02:00.416
but keep their mind

43
00:02:00.416 --> 00:02:03.125
fixed on Lord Krishna alone.

44
00:02:03.125 --> 00:02:05.500
In the eternal form of Lord Krishna

45
00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.958
their mind remains in meditation.

46
00:02:08.958 --> 00:02:09.875
The key difference

47
00:02:09.875 --> 00:02:11.208
between mahatmas

48
00:02:11.208 --> 00:02:14.375
and ignorant people lies in their differing faith

49
00:02:14.375 --> 00:02:17.458
toward Lord Krishna's divine form.

50
00:02:17.458 --> 00:02:21.458
While mahatmas know Lord Krishna as
bhutadim avyayam –

51
00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:25.083
that is, the origin of all beings,

52
00:02:25.083 --> 00:02:28.375
indestructible and eternal in form –

53
00:02:28.375 --> 00:02:30.791
and recognise His true nature,

54
00:02:30.791 --> 00:02:32.291
the ignorant person

55
00:02:32.291 --> 00:02:35.041
remains unaware of this truth.

56
00:02:35.041 --> 00:02:36.291
And it is this knowledge

57
00:02:36.291 --> 00:02:38.750
that keeps the mahatma free

58
00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:40.291
from the illusions of the world.

59
00:02:40.291 --> 00:02:41.333
Not only that,

60
00:02:41.333 --> 00:02:43.666
through the divine nature of this devotion,

61
00:02:43.666 --> 00:02:46.583
these devotees are not merely freed from maya,

62
00:02:46.583 --> 00:02:49.125
but remain directly connected

63
00:02:49.125 --> 00:02:51.375
to Lord Krishna's inner power.

64
00:02:51.375 --> 00:02:53.166
They are not bound by

65
00:02:53.166 --> 00:02:56.250
the material qualities of nature, but

66
00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:58.708
experience spiritual freedom and joy.

67
00:02:58.708 --> 00:02:59.458
This verse

68
00:02:59.458 --> 00:03:00.625
invites us too

69
00:03:00.625 --> 00:03:01.750
to walk that same path

70
00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:05.500
of devotion and surrender 
that leads to true liberation

71
00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:06.458
and an inner

72
00:03:06.458 --> 00:03:09.083
bond with Lord Krishna.

73
00:03:09.083 --> 00:03:12.208
It tells us that through love and service alone,

74
00:03:12.208 --> 00:03:13.250
a person can be freed

75
00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:14.291
from material bondage

76
00:03:14.291 --> 00:03:15.291
and attain

77
00:03:15.291 --> 00:03:17.541
the divine presence of Lord Krishna,

78
00:03:17.541 --> 00:03:21.291
where there is only peace and joy.

79
00:03:26.291 --> 00:03:27.291
Knowledge is

80
00:03:27.291 --> 00:03:31.500
the foundation of action.

81
00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.625
In your life too,

82
00:03:34.625 --> 00:03:38.166
as your knowledge is,

83
00:03:38.166 --> 00:03:41.000
so will your actions be.

84
00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:45.625
When you understand something deeply,

85
00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:52.583
it shapes your conduct as well.

86
00:03:52.583 --> 00:03:54.416
If your understanding

87
00:03:54.416 --> 00:03:58.625
of a person or situation is distorted,

88
00:03:58.625 --> 00:04:02.750
your response will be too.

89
00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:05.250
For example,

90
00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:07.791
if you believe

91
00:04:07.791 --> 00:04:11.541
that success lies only in wealth,

92
00:04:11.541 --> 00:04:14.583
you will chase money

93
00:04:14.583 --> 00:04:18.791
while neglecting relationships
 and mental peace,

94
00:04:18.791 --> 00:04:23.625
and ultimately find only
 dissatisfaction and emptiness.

95
00:04:23.625 --> 00:04:25.708
Right action

96
00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:29.000
comes only from right knowledge.

97
00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.000
So

98
00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:34.375
understand My teachings, My guidance,

99
00:04:34.375 --> 00:04:39.458
and the nature of this creation.

100
00:04:39.458 --> 00:04:43.750
Receive the wisdom of the Bhagavad Gita,

101
00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:46.708
and after receiving this knowledge,

102
00:04:46.708 --> 00:04:49.250
your actions, decisions,

103
00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:52.125
priorities, and relationships

104
00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:54.791
will align with truth,

105
00:04:54.791 --> 00:04:57.750
and a clarity,

106
00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:00.000
a purpose will enter your life.

107
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:06.541
So do not act in haste without
 proper understanding,

108
00:05:06.541 --> 00:05:08.875
whether it is a personal decision,

109
00:05:08.875 --> 00:05:12.750
a relationship, or the spiritual path.

110
00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:15.083
In every area, first

111
00:05:15.083 --> 00:05:18.041
gain the knowledge of that area,

112
00:05:18.041 --> 00:05:19.375
then act.

113
00:05:19.375 --> 00:05:22.625
And yes, remember –

114
00:05:22.625 --> 00:05:24.583
the highest knowledge

115
00:05:24.583 --> 00:05:27.333
is the wisdom of the Bhagavad Gita,

116
00:05:27.333 --> 00:05:31.708
which I want to offer you,

117
00:05:31.708 --> 00:05:36.000
and this very knowledge will
 lead you to true happiness

118
00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:39.083
and fulfilment.

119
00:05:43.833 --> 00:05:46.375
In today's society,

120
00:05:46.375 --> 00:05:49.416
just by looking at someone’s attire,

121
00:05:49.416 --> 00:05:53.125
people often consider them a mahatma.

122
00:05:53.125 --> 00:05:56.083
Now I do not mean that those who wear such

123
00:05:56.083 --> 00:05:59.416
attire are not mahatmas.

124
00:05:59.416 --> 00:06:01.958
What I mean is

125
00:06:01.958 --> 00:06:05.791
that before calling someone a mahatma,

126
00:06:05.791 --> 00:06:08.083
do not judge only

127
00:06:08.083 --> 00:06:10.875
by outer form or titles.

128
00:06:10.875 --> 00:06:12.750
A true mahatma

129
00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:15.416
is not known by clothing,

130
00:06:15.416 --> 00:06:17.666
nor by rituals.

131
00:06:17.666 --> 00:06:20.500
They are known by their state of mind

132
00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.916
and their inner feelings.

133
00:06:23.916 --> 00:06:28.833
In My view, a mahatma is one

134
00:06:28.833 --> 00:06:30.500
who recognises Me

135
00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:33.625
as the eternal

136
00:06:33.625 --> 00:06:37.083
and indestructible cause of creation,

137
00:06:37.083 --> 00:06:42.208
and remains fully absorbed in My service.

138
00:06:42.208 --> 00:06:44.000
But today

139
00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:48.333
in society, people are judged by their attire,

140
00:06:48.333 --> 00:06:53.000
speeches, or display.

141
00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:56.250
But what truly matters

142
00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:58.875
is the depth of their thoughts

143
00:06:58.875 --> 00:07:01.541
and the firmness of their faith.

144
00:07:01.541 --> 00:07:04.375
So before seeking guidance

145
00:07:04.375 --> 00:07:07.583
from anyone, ask –

146
00:07:07.583 --> 00:07:09.625
is their mind

147
00:07:09.625 --> 00:07:12.208
absorbed in Me?

148
00:07:12.208 --> 00:07:13.916
Is their knowledge

149
00:07:13.916 --> 00:07:16.541
rooted in truth?

150
00:07:16.541 --> 00:07:18.416
Are their actions

151
00:07:18.416 --> 00:07:22.458
filled with selfless service and devotion?

152
00:07:22.458 --> 00:07:24.750
If their purpose

153
00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.708
is to remain immersed in liberation,

154
00:07:27.708 --> 00:07:30.291
then receive their knowledge.

155
00:07:30.291 --> 00:07:34.750
Otherwise, if their goal is only material gain,

156
00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:37.375
wealth, or fame,

157
00:07:37.375 --> 00:07:39.500
then be cautious.

158
00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:43.416
Always remember, true mahatmas

159
00:07:43.416 --> 00:07:46.041
through their knowledge and actions

160
00:07:46.041 --> 00:07:49.041
uplift others.

161
00:07:49.041 --> 00:07:50.333
So

162
00:07:50.333 --> 00:07:54.125
do not be swayed only by outer appearance,

163
00:07:54.125 --> 00:07:55.166
but recognise true

164
00:07:55.166 --> 00:07:59.041
love, humility, and devotion.

165
00:07:59.041 --> 00:08:00.416
And yes,

166
00:08:00.416 --> 00:08:04.833
when you receive the right guidance,

167
00:08:04.833 --> 00:08:05.791
only then

168
00:08:05.791 --> 00:08:08.916
will you find clarity, peace,

169
00:08:08.916 --> 00:08:11.875
and purpose in life.

170
00:08:16.791 --> 00:08:19.875
In any professional environment,

171
00:08:19.875 --> 00:08:21.833
two pillars of

172
00:08:21.833 --> 00:08:25.208
excellence are essential.

173
00:08:25.208 --> 00:08:29.750
They are knowledge and
 an environment of safety.

174
00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:31.041
Let me explain this

175
00:08:31.041 --> 00:08:34.916
through the example of mahatmas.

176
00:08:34.916 --> 00:08:37.708
Just as mahatmas,

177
00:08:37.708 --> 00:08:41.208
having understood My true nature,

178
00:08:41.208 --> 00:08:45.166
remain absorbed in My devotion,

179
00:08:45.166 --> 00:08:48.750
and I, through My divine power,

180
00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:52.666
also provide them protection – in the same way,

181
00:08:52.666 --> 00:08:56.750
in your work, to your colleagues

182
00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:00.625
and teammates, give the right knowledge,

183
00:09:00.625 --> 00:09:03.750
because when a person understands well

184
00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:06.958
the reason behind their work –

185
00:09:06.958 --> 00:09:09.875
why they are doing what they do –

186
00:09:09.875 --> 00:09:12.083
they do that work

187
00:09:12.083 --> 00:09:14.041
with full absorption.

188
00:09:14.041 --> 00:09:19.083
Remember, the right knowledge
 brings dedication

189
00:09:19.083 --> 00:09:22.166
and makes work excellent.

190
00:09:22.166 --> 00:09:25.458
When a person has the right knowledge,

191
00:09:25.458 --> 00:09:28.125
purpose and clarity

192
00:09:28.125 --> 00:09:31.875
come naturally to their actions.

193
00:09:31.875 --> 00:09:35.333
But knowledge alone is not enough.

194
00:09:35.333 --> 00:09:37.291
As I said before,

195
00:09:37.291 --> 00:09:39.041
mahatmas

196
00:09:39.041 --> 00:09:41.250
feel secure under the shelter

197
00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:44.666
of My divine power – in the same way,

198
00:09:44.666 --> 00:09:47.708
at the workplace, when a person

199
00:09:47.708 --> 00:09:50.000
feels emotionally, financially,

200
00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:53.291
or mentally secure,

201
00:09:53.291 --> 00:09:57.958
only then can they work wholeheartedly.

202
00:09:57.958 --> 00:10:00.666
And it is the duty of a leader

203
00:10:00.666 --> 00:10:03.666
to provide both – knowledge and safety –

204
00:10:03.666 --> 00:10:07.458
in a balanced way.

205
00:10:07.458 --> 00:10:10.791
Inspire your team with the right knowledge,

206
00:10:10.791 --> 00:10:13.708
and create an environment

207
00:10:13.708 --> 00:10:16.583
where everyone feels safe, respected,

208
00:10:16.583 --> 00:10:19.708
and free.

209
00:10:19.708 --> 00:10:22.625
And when this happens,

210
00:10:22.625 --> 00:10:26.041
people do not work reluctantly,

211
00:10:26.041 --> 00:10:30.208
but work with full absorption, with purpose,

212
00:10:30.208 --> 00:10:33.916
and with joy.
